title: station_hub_hub
tags: hub station
---
<<play_sfx cue_ui_view_open>>
Welcome to Nexus Station! The bustling marketplace offers many opportunities. #line:station_hub_hub_00 #illustration:illustration_station
-> Visit Marketplace #line:station_hub_hub_01
    <<detour station_hub_market_menu>>
    <<jump station_hub_hub>>
-> Station Bar #line:station_hub_hub_02
    <<detour station_hub_bar_menu>>
    <<jump station_hub_hub>>
-> Research Lab #line:station_hub_hub_03
    <<detour station_hub_lab_menu>>
    <<jump station_hub_hub>>
-> Mission Control #line:station_hub_hub_04
    <<detour station_hub_mission_control>>
    <<jump station_hub_hub>>
-> Repair All Ships #line:station_hub_hub_05
    <<repair_ship 100>>
    <<jump station_hub_hub>>
-> Visit Hangar Bay #line:station_hub_hub_06
    <<open_ship_editor>>
-> Undock #line:station_hub_hub_07 #leave
    <<stop>>
===

title: station_hub_market_menu
tags: 
---
The marketplace is filled with vendors hawking exotic wares. #line:station_hub_market_menu_00
-> Trade Goods #line:station_hub_market_menu_01
    <<open_merchant merchant_station_market>>
    <<jump station_hub_market_menu>>
-> View Bounties #line:station_hub_market_menu_02
    <<detour station_hub_bounties>>
    <<jump station_hub_market_menu>>
-> Back #line:station_hub_market_menu_03 #leave
    <<return>>
===

title: station_hub_bounties
tags: 
---
The bounty board lists several active contracts. #line:station_hub_bounties_00
-> Accept Pirate Hunt #line:station_hub_bounties_01
    <<set_fact pirate_bounty_accepted true>>
    <<return>>
<<if quest_not_started("quest_hostile_blackbox")>>
    -> Accept Hostile Blackbox Contract #line:station_hub_bounties_02 #quest
        <<start_quest quest_hostile_blackbox>>
        <<return>>
<<endif>>
-> Generate Bounty Template Mission #line:station_hub_bounties_03 #quest
    <<start_quest contract_bounty_probe>>
    <<return>>
-> Back #line:station_hub_bounties_04 #leave
    <<return>>
===

title: station_hub_mission_control
tags: mission quest intel
---
Mission Control tracks contracts, trigger listeners, and experimental quest chains. #line:station_hub_mission_control_00
<<if quest_not_started("quest_survey_local_materials")>>
    -> Accept Material Turn-In Test #line:station_hub_mission_control_01 #quest
        <<start_quest quest_survey_local_materials>>
        <<return>>
<<endif>>
<<if quest_not_started("quest_station_data_delivery")>>
    -> Accept Station Data Delivery Test #line:station_hub_mission_control_02 #quest
        <<start_quest quest_station_data_delivery>>
        <<return>>
<<endif>>
<<if quest_not_started("quest_station_boarding_trial")>>
    -> Accept Boarding Trial Test #line:station_hub_mission_control_03 #quest
        <<start_quest quest_station_boarding_trial>>
        <<return>>
<<endif>>
<<if quest_not_started("quest_whisper_chain")>>
    -> Start Whisper Chain Storyline #line:station_hub_mission_control_04 #quest
        <<start_quest quest_whisper_chain>>
        <<return>>
<<endif>>
<<if quest_not_started("quest_debug_fail_sandbox")>>
    -> Accept Fail-State Sandbox #line:station_hub_mission_control_05 #quest
        <<start_quest quest_debug_fail_sandbox>>
        <<return>>
<<endif>>
-> Generate Signal Relay Template Mission #line:station_hub_mission_control_06 #quest
    <<start_quest contract_signal_relay>>
    <<return>>
-> Generate Material Sweep Template Mission #line:station_hub_mission_control_07 #quest
    <<start_quest contract_material_sweep>>
    <<return>>
<<if quest_active("quest_debug_fail_sandbox")>>
    -> Force Fail Sandbox Quest #line:station_hub_mission_control_08 #quest
        <<fail_quest quest_debug_fail_sandbox>>
        <<return>>
<<endif>>
<<if quest_active("quest_debug_fail_sandbox")>>
    -> Complete Sandbox Quest #line:station_hub_mission_control_09 #quest
        <<complete_quest quest_debug_fail_sandbox>>
        <<return>>
<<endif>>
-> Back #line:station_hub_mission_control_10 #leave
    <<return>>
===

title: station_hub_bar_menu
tags: 
---
The station bar is dimly lit and filled with suspicious characters. #line:station_hub_bar_menu_00
-> Talk to Shady Figure <<if visited_count("shady_man_start") == 0>> #line:station_hub_bar_menu_01
    <<detour shady_man_start>>
    <<jump station_hub_bar_menu>>
// LEGACY-UNAVAILABLE PLAY_FROM_POOL(bar_encounters): -> Random Encounter #line:station_hub_bar_menu_02
-> Back #line:station_hub_bar_menu_03 #leave
    <<return>>
===

title: station_hub_lab_menu
tags: 
---
The research lab hums with advanced equipment. #line:station_hub_lab_menu_00
-> Upgrade Shields <<if (credits() >= 500) and (credits() >= 500)>> #line:station_hub_lab_menu_01
    <<take_credits 500>>
    <<return>>
-> View Research #line:station_hub_lab_menu_02
    <<jump station_hub_research_view>>
-> Back #line:station_hub_lab_menu_03 #leave
    <<return>>
===

title: station_hub_research_view
tags: lab
---
Current research projects are displayed on the screen. #line:station_hub_research_view_00
-> Contribute Research Points #line:station_hub_research_view_01
    <<add_fact research_points 10>>
    <<return>>
-> Back #line:station_hub_research_view_02 #leave
    <<return>>
===

